the operands, the reversed source and the slice parent are read; nothing else is: true
a constant fetch's target, written then read, stays a read: true
no destination is a read: true
a merge buffer is not a read of its node: true
the mentions are all named nodes, merge buffer aside: true
an unread slice parent is materialized with its view: true
a slice mentions its parent and view: true
a slice parent read later in the sequence leaves the materialization set: true
the sequence mentions its slice, parent and destination: true
while the value reads keep it: true
one slice aliases its parent and the other copies it: true
each slice's forward code reads the parent: true
